Package: snsf.oa.ror.zurich.26
Title: Code and data for an analysis of the SNSF OA monitoring presented
    at ROR Zürich 2026
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Simon", "Gorin", , "simon.gorin@snf.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7462-0446"))
Description: This package contains the code and data to reproduce an
    analysis presented at the Research on Research Event in Zürich on
    2026/01/29. The analysis focuses on the coverage, within different
    academic databases, of scientific publications identified from Swiss
    National Science Foundation (SNSF) grants. Identifying these
    publications is critical for monitoring the open access of
    publications from SNSF grants.
